                                                "sense_id": "b2448e6e-0afb-338c-ae1e-73bce7ff75ce",
                                                "text": "I'm not into that one-night thing. I think a person should get to know someone and even be in love with them before you use them and degrade them"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e31d3808-4bca-3c3a-8e37-aaf3ed5a7eb9",
